Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a different best_single hypothesis with a strong seasonal model CWT_rf to see if it beats the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_rf"}

